---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800 mt-16 pt-12 pb-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800">
      <!-- Col 1: About Brand -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
            ⚡
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-black text-white">SarkariPhotoResizer.com</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          SarkariPhotoResizer.com is a free, high-speed, 100% private online utility designed for Indian competitive exam applicants (SSC, UPSC, Railway, Banking, Police, State PSCs). All photos, signatures, and certificates are compressed client-side inside your browser without uploading to any remote server.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">
          <span>🔒</span>
          <span>Zero Server Uploads • 100% Safe &amp; On-Device Processing</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Fast Tools -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Exam Presets</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/#tool" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">SSC Photo Resizer (20KB - 50KB)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#tool" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">SSC Signature Resizer (10KB - 20KB)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#tool" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Railway RRB Photo Resizer</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#tool" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">UPSC IAS / NDA Photo Resizer</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#tool" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">IBPS / SBI Clerk Photo Resizer</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#tool" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">UP Police / WB Police Resizer</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Legal & Trust (Essential for AdSense) -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Company &amp; Legal</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">About Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Terms of Service</a></li>
          <li><a href="/disclaimer" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Disclaimer</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Contact Us</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Disclaimer & Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p>
        &copy; {currentYear} SarkariPhotoResizer.com. All rights reserved. Not affiliated with any government agency.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px]">
        Designed for speed, privacy, and seamless government job form submissions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
